# NOTE: src/web/routeTree.gen.ts is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It's generated by @tanstack/router-plugin, but `tsc --noEmit` needs it — main.tsx
# imports it — so ignoring it means a fresh clone can't typecheck and CI fails before
# anything has had a chance to generate it. Committing it is also what TanStack
# recommends. Don't hand-edit it; it's rewritten on dev/build.

